cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "SPION_Quant: voxel-wise quantification of SPION concentration from multi-echo MRI"
abstract: >-
  Tools and analysis for quantifying superparamagnetic iron oxide nanoparticle
  (SPION) concentration from multi-echo spin-echo MRI. Includes an echo-time
  DICOM viewer, 3D segmentation, voxel-wise T2 relaxometry with AIC-based model
  selection, an intensity normalisation scheme, and the classifier benchmark
  reported in the accompanying manuscript.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yael
    family-names: Suarez
